     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello <div><br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,36,38);font-family:Arial,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">I would like to know how to access a variable through an sqlquery after uploading a file in shinyUI.</span><br></div></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,36,38);font-family:Arial,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></div><div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">SampleDataset &lt;-</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">id  age salary</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">23  38  34000</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">24  32  35000</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">25  31  35670</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">26  45  39000</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">From the above dataset I need to find the list of id&#39;s whose salary is less than 35k. This is the dynamicinput from ShinyUI.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">Code I tried for Fileupload <b>Ui.R</b></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">library(shiny)</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">shinyUI(pageWithSidebar(</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">  headerPanel(&quot;CSV Viewer&quot;),</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">  sidebarPanel(</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    fileInput(&#39;file1&#39;, &#39;Choose CSV File&#39;,</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">              accept=c(&#39;text/csv&#39;, &#39;text/comma-separated-values,text/plain&#39;, &#39;.csv&#39;)),</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    tags$hr(),</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    checkboxInput(&#39;header&#39;, &#39;Header&#39;, TRUE),</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    radioButtons(&#39;sep&#39;, &#39;Separator&#39;,</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">                 c(Comma=&#39;,&#39;,</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">                   Semicolon=&#39;;&#39;,</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">                   Tab=&#39;\\t&#39;),</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">                 &#39;Comma&#39;),</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    radioButtons(&#39;quote&#39;, &#39;Quote&#39;,</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">                 c(None=&#39;&#39;,</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">                   &#39;Double Quote&#39;=&#39;&quot;&#39;,</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">                   &#39;Single Quote&#39;=&quot;&#39;&quot;),</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=