</font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    # file, it will be a data frame with &#39;name&#39;, &#39;size&#39;, &#39;type&#39;, and &#39;datapath&#39; </span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    # columns. The &#39;datapath&#39; column will contain the local filenames where the </span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    # data can be found.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    inFile &lt;- input$file1</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    if (is.null(inFile))</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">      return(NULL)</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    read.csv(inFile$datapath, header=input$header, sep=input$sep, quote=input$quote)</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">  })</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">})</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><b>P.S</b></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#222426\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">How to define a where condition in sqlquery for a dynamic variable(salary)</span></font></div></div></div>"
